Package: mega2rtutorial
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2017-08-17
Title: A Tutorial Vignette and Example Data for the Mega2R Suite of R Packages 
Description: The suite of Mega2R R packages (mega2r, mega2vcf,
mega2genabel, mega2pedgene) all use as input genetic data that have been
reformatted and stored in a SQLite database; this database is initially
created by the standalone Mega2 C++ program.  This particular package,
mega2rtutorial, provides a single unified vignette for these R packages,
as well as simulated example data. 
